        "created_at": "2012-11-06T23:34:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi, please tell me if I am right.</p><p>I am playing Absolute Zero. I have 3 items ( Cold damage into healing, Fire damage cause Cold Damage and +1 Cold Damage), there is a Atlantean Environment that cause +1 damage dealt and +1 Healing.</p><p>I play the One Shot that deal cold damage then deal me fire damage equal to the amount of cold damage caused.</p><p>Let say I do X damage basic, as it is cold I am causing X+2 damage to the opponent.&nbsp;</p><p>1- Am I suffering X+2 Fire damage or X+3 Fire damage, or even X+4 ?</p><p>2- When I generate Cold damage for the Fire Damage being dealt to me, do thoses damage got booste +1/+2/+0 ?</p><p>3- When I change so thoses Cold Damage heal me did I got the +1 for healing too ?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
