        "created_at": "2012-11-06T23:52:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's say you deal 3 Cold.&nbsp; Focused Apertures increases that to 4.&nbsp; Phosphorescent Chamber increases that to 5.&nbsp; You deal that to a Villain Target (assuming this is Frost-Bound Drain).&nbsp; You then deal 3 Fire to yourself.&nbsp; FA doesn't increase that, but PC ups it to 4.&nbsp; You take 4, then you can deal 4 separate Cold damage.&nbsp; That Cold damages increases to 5 due to FA, and 6 due to PC.&nbsp; If you choose to heal yourself with that, PC would increase that HP recovery to 7.</p><p>Absolute Zero likes math.</p>",
