        "created_at": "2012-11-06T23:58:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That depends.&nbsp; Which card are you talking about?&nbsp; I believe Frost-Bound Drain is a&nbsp;One-Shot that&nbsp;deals 3 Cold to a non-hero target and 3 Fire to yourself.&nbsp; Thermal Shockwave is an Ongoing that&nbsp;deals up to three targets 1 Cold damage and then you take that much Fire.&nbsp; Is it one of those?</p>",
